\[
r_{\parallel}
=\frac{\cos\theta_t-(Z_i/Z_t)\cos\theta_i}
{\cos\theta_t+(Z_i/Z_t)\cos\theta_i},
\qquad
r_{\perp}
=\frac{\cos\theta_i-(Z_i/Z_t)\cos\theta_t}
{\cos\theta_i+(Z_i/Z_t)\cos\theta_t}.
\tag*{[1]}
\]

Final answer:
